own onto the side, and lies s…\nmesh2motion/Death_B  1.875s once  death — thrown back off the feet into the air and lands flat on the ground\nmesh2motion/Death_C  2.208s once  death — falls straight back, rolls over and lies spread out\nquaternius/Death01  2.4s once  death — staggers and falls flat on the back\nquaternius/Death01_RM  2.4s once  death root-motion — staggers and falls flat on the back (travels)\ncmu/Fall_On_Face  2.2s once  death hurt — Toppling forward flat onto the face\nquaternius/Hit_Knockback  0.833s once  hurt death — hit hard: thrown back off the feet onto the back, and lie…\nquaternius/Hit_Knockback_RM  0.833s once  hurt death root-motion — hit hard and thrown back onto the back, tr…\nreport: out/anim/find-death/report.json\n--- get up\nx anim: ok: 7 clips and 23 CMU takes match, the best shown\ncmu/Get_Up_Face_Down  6.1s once  getup — Getting up from lying face down: push up on the arms, a knee under, …\ncmu/Get_Up_From_Back  7.067s once  getup — Getting up from lying on the back: sit up, roll to a knee, stand\ncmu/Get_Up_From_Side  8.5s once  getup — Getting up from lying on the side\ncmu/Sit_Down_Get_Up  5.967s once  sit — Sitting down on a chair and getting up again (no chair is drawn)\nmesh2motion/Zombie_Rise  3.375s once  zombie getup — rises from the ground: lying, sits up stiffly and gets u…\nquaternius/LayToIdle  1.533s once  getup — gets up from lying on the back to standing\ncmu/Jumping_Jacks_Loop  1.133s loop  exercise — Jumping jacks: hop the feet apart while the arms swing up ove…\ncmu 77_16  10.9s reaction  fit 18/109  laying down, getting up, careful ready pose\ncmu 77_17  12.0s reaction  fit 23/103  laying down, getting up, careful ready pose\ncmu 77_18  14.2s reaction  fit 22/118 (inverted)  laying down on back, getting up, careful ready pose\ncmu 111_06  12.7s reaction  fit 30/185 (inverted)  Get up from floor\n--- taunt\nx anim: ok: 0 clips and 0 CMU takes match\nreport: out/anim/find-taunt/report.json\n--- pray\nx anim: ok